````

Rationale (short): previously sentence-boundary logic skipped newline/space tokens but not delimiter tokens. If a sentence ends with a delimiter token ('.','!','?'), writing an extra separator produced the unwanted double space. These two checks prevent that while keeping existing token/space semantics.
